sequenceDiagram
    participant DP as Data Principal
    participant CM as Consent Manager
    participant DF as Data Fiduciary

    DP->>CM: Grant consent for Purpose X
    Note over CM: Records: principal_id, fiduciary_id,<br/>purpose_id, timestamp, action=GRANT
    CM->>DF: Forward consent grant (metadata only)
    DF->>DP: Request personal data (direct channel)
    DP->>DF: Provide personal data (E2E encrypted)
    Note over CM: CM never sees personal data payload

    DP->>CM: Withdraw consent for Purpose X
    Note over CM: Records: action=WITHDRAW, timestamp
    CM->>DF: Forward withdrawal notification
    DF->>DF: Cease processing, initiate erasure
